WEBVTT

00:00:00.088 --> 00:00:03.988
Setup and Install checks prerequisites and the configured framework

00:00:03.988 --> 00:00:04.575
paths.

00:00:04.988 --> 00:00:09.588
Use the compatible legacy runtime for Workflows and Scripts one point

00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:10.038
x.

00:00:10.325 --> 00:00:14.025
Keep the separate two point x runtime and command for its preview

00:00:14.038 --> 00:00:15.838
plan and apply surface.

00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:19.588
A detected path is not proof of provider compatibility.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.462
Verify the relevant non-mutating command before allowing operational

00:00:24.462 --> 00:00:24.812
work.

00:00:26.017 --> 00:00:30.104
Administrators create named console users and assign the appropriate

00:00:30.104 --> 00:00:32.654
administrator, operator or viewer role.

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:36.267
These are Orchestrator accounts, not local P E accounts.

00:00:36.679 --> 00:00:40.504
Provision initial access through a secure channel, review who can

00:00:40.517 --> 00:00:43.754
execute changes and keep management access restricted.

00:00:44.154 --> 00:00:48.392
A visible navigation link never grants permission beyond the server

00:00:48.392 --> 00:00:49.617
authorization checks.

00:00:50.808 --> 00:00:55.333
Settings contains runtime paths, connection profiles, governance,

00:00:55.546 --> 00:00:58.571
storage, notifications and build identity.

00:00:58.971 --> 00:01:01.508
Review a profile before using its defaults.

00:01:01.883 --> 00:01:05.408
A connection test has a specific scope and does not create target

00:01:05.408 --> 00:01:08.558
accounts or prove every A P I permission.

00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:13.233
Preserve effective trust mounts and runtime settings during updates.

00:01:13.621 --> 00:01:17.808
Review exact approval policy before enabling a sensitive lane.

00:01:19.017 --> 00:01:23.004
Use the established backup procedure for the actual storage backend.

00:01:23.429 --> 00:01:28.104
Preserve credentials, configuration, recovery records, job evidence

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.567
and required host settings.

00:01:29.954 --> 00:01:34.879
Retain the matching database and data recovery materials independently.

00:01:35.279 --> 00:01:38.392
Test readability and rehearse restoration safely.

00:01:38.804 --> 00:01:42.942
Application-image rollback is not database restoration, and restoring

00:01:42.942 --> 00:01:46.579
the Orchestrator does not reverse changes already made on Nutanix

00:01:46.579 --> 00:01:47.192
systems.

00:01:48.338 --> 00:01:52.850
Audit Log helps trace authentication, authorization, configuration,

00:01:53.225 --> 00:01:54.925
jobs and governance actions.

00:01:55.338 --> 00:01:59.575
Correlate the record with a timestamp, exact installed build and job

00:01:59.575 --> 00:02:00.262
identifier.

00:02:00.675 --> 00:02:04.075
Settings About and the running image distinguish patch builds;

00:02:04.362 --> 00:02:06.338
the footer release alone may not.

00:02:06.738 --> 00:02:09.312
Export only sanitized support evidence.

00:02:09.725 --> 00:02:15.188
Keep passwords, session tokens, private keys and secret-bearing configuration

00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:16.450
out of public reports.
